{"id":"00052","root":"uni00052_1","name":{"ja":"井河　アサギ","en":"Igawa Asagi"},"title":{"ja":"【最強の対魔忍】","en":"【Strongest Taimanin】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【最強の対魔忍】 井河　アサギ","en":"【Strongest Taimanin】 Igawa Asagi"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-10-19","limited":true,"characterId":16,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍を率いる総隊長にして最強の対魔忍と目されている正義のくﾉ一。カオス・アリーナでの死闘で朧を倒すも恋人・沢木恭介を失う。自身も死闘の中で朧に囚われ、邪悪な魔界医療技術によって肉体を改造されるも、７年前に捕虜にした魔科医・桐生の手によって元の肉体に治療されている。天才的な剣術と体術、人知を超える光速のスピードが武器。また、東京キングダムの死闘では対魔忍の中に潜む真正の魔の力に覚醒し、その能力を格段に向上させて「隼の術」極意を体得する。政府によって設立された対魔忍養成学校・五車学園の校長を務めている。得物は忍者刀。","en":"Asagi, the supreme commander of the Taimanin and hailed as the strongest Taimanin, is a righteous kunoichi. In a fierce battle at the Chaos Arena she defeated Iga Oboro but lost her lover Sawaki Kyousuke. She herself was captured by Oboro during the fight and had her body altered with evil Demon Realm medical technology, yet seven years ago a captive demon scientist named Kiryu restored her original body. She wields genius-level swordsmanship, martial arts, and light-speed speed as her weapons. In the deadly clash of Tokyo Kingdom she awakened the true demonic power hidden within the Taimanin, dramatically enhancing her abilities and mastering the ultimate \"Falcon Technique.\" She serves as the principal of Gosha Academy, the government-established Taimanin training school. Her weapon is a ninja sword."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"なかせひな","forms":[{"id":"uni00052_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[136,272],"def":[111,222],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","30001"]},{"id":"uni00052_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[207,414],"def":[157,314],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","30001","30002"]},{"id":"uni00052_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[201